<title>SINGAPORE: SPH interim dividend at S$0.12.</title>
<headline>SPH interim dividend at S$0.12.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Press Holdings Ltd said on Thursday it was declaring a pre-tax dividend of Singapore $0.12 for half year ended February 28, 1997 against S$0.10 previously.  </p>
<p>The newspaper group saw a 9.2 percent growth in interim net profit to S$172.38 million and a 3.4 percent rise in turnover to S$455.05 million.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
